{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":503713,"name":"Lashawn Martin","username":"Lashawn_Martin","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/l/57b2e6/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-29T20:06:45.631Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-503713-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-503713-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-503713-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-503713-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI’ve got 1Password connected and logins in the “Shared with Grok Bot” vault. Connect finds the Instagram item fine. When Grok Bot autofills on its own computer/browser, the fill card shows Filled (even reported fill+submit once), but only the username lands. Password field stays empty, Log In stays disabled.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSame false-success thing showsup on every site. The vault password itself is fine — works when I sign in manually / on my Mac.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBasically bots can’t finish logins without me babysitting the Mac, which kind of kills the point of Shared with Grok Bot.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-503713-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-503713-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eConnect 1Password to Grok Bot and put Instagram (and Letterboxd) login in Shared with Grok Bot vault.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOn Grok Bot’s computer, open \u003ca href=\"https://www.instagram.com/accounts/login/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003ehttps://www.instagram.com/accounts/login/\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTrigger Shared 1Password Connect autofill for that page.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWatch the fill card say Filled.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCheck the form: username is filled, password is still empty, Log In stays disabled. Instagram may show incorrect login. Same pattern on Letterboxd.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-503713-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-503713-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConnect should fill BOTH username and password (or clearly fail). A Filled success should mean the password field actually has a value so the bot can sign in without me on the Mac.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-503713-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-503713-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eScreenshots / Screen Recordings\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/5/4/54e9de1330c637c25dac84bbe7d40f801589fa0a.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/c7bajc0e8tsvNbZowRFVFtZarVM.png?dl=1\" title=\"image.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/5/4/54e9de1330c637c25dac84bbe7d40f801589fa0a_2_687x500.png\" alt=\"image.png\" data-base62-sha1=\"c7bajc0e8tsvNbZowRFVFtZarVM\" width=\"687\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/5/4/54e9de1330c637c25dac84bbe7d40f801589fa0a_2_687x500.png, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/5/4/54e9de1330c637c25dac84bbe7d40f801589fa0a_2_1030x750.png 1.5x, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/5/4/54e9de1330c637c25dac84bbe7d40f801589fa0a_2_1374x1000.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"E8E8E7\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eimage.png\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e2282×1660 440 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-503713-operating-system-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-503713-operating-system-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMacOS\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-503713-version-information-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-503713-version-information-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot:\u003cbr\u003e\nOS: macOS (2019 13-inch MacBook Pro)\u003cbr\u003e\nIssue is on Grok Bot’s remote computer/browser Connect fill, not Mac Chrome autofill.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAlso filed in-app Help → Send Feedback with reply requested on Sep 29 2026.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-503713-for-ai-issues-which-model-did-you-use-8\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-503713-for-ai-issues-which-model-did-you-use-8\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eFor AI issues: which model did you use?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003en/a — this is Grok Bot 1Password Connect autofill, not a chat model bug\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-503713-additional-information-9\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-503713-additional-information-9\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eAdditional Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRelated thread for connection issues (mine is fill false-success after already connected): \u003ca href=\"https://forum.cursor.com/t/grokbot-1password/173142\" class=\"inline-onebox\"\u003eGrokbot \u0026amp; 1Password\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eScreenshot from the Grok Bot chat attached below (two Filled cards, then the diagnosis).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eScreenshot from the Grok Bot chat (two Filled cards, then the diagnosis):\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/5/4/54e9de1330c637c25dac84bbe7d40f801589fa0a.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/c7bajc0e8tsvNbZowRFVFtZarVM.png?dl=1\" title=\"1password-connect-autofill-bug.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/5/4/54e9de1330c637c25dac84bbe7d40f801589fa0a_2_687x500.png\" alt=\"1password-connect-autofill-bug.png\" data-base62-sha1=\"c7bajc0e8tsvNbZowRFVFtZarVM\" width=\"687\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/5/4/54e9de1330c637c25dac84bbe7d40f801589fa0a_2_687x500.png, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/5/4/54e9de1330c637c25dac84bbe7d40f801589fa0a_2_1030x750.png 1.5x, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/5/4/54e9de1330c637c25dac84bbe7d40f801589fa0a_2_1374x1000.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"E8E8E7\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003e1password-connect-autofill-bug.png\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e2282×1660 440 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-503713-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-10\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-503713-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-10\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes - Cursor is unusable\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-29T20:06:53.410Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":8,"reads":6,"readers_count":5,"score":41.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":173365,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-shared-1password-autofill-says-filled-but-password-stays-empty-instagram","display_username":"Lashawn Martin","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://www.instagram.com/accounts/login/","internal":false,"reflection":false,"clicks":0},{"url":"https://forum.cursor.com/t/grokbot-1password/173142","internal":true,"reflection":false,"title":"Grokbot \u0026 1Password","clicks":0}],"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":140294,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-shared-1password-autofill-says-filled-but-password-stays-empty-instagram/173365/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":503859,"name":"Dean Rie","username":"deanrie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-30T05:06:22.307Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey, thanks for the detailed report and the screenshot. I can see two Filled cards in the bot chat, followed by diagnostics.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat you’re describing is a known issue we’re tracking. On some login pages, including Instagram and Letterboxd, the page won’t accept the password that 1Password auto-fills. After that, Grok Bot clears the password field for security. The card still shows Filled even though the login didn’t actually go through. That’s why you see the username filled but the password field empty. This isn’t something in your setup. The password in your vault is fine, as you noticed. I can’t share a timeline yet, but I’ll reply in the thread when there’s an update.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor now, login should work using either of these options:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAsk the bot to use the secure in-chat login form for Instagram instead of 1Password. You enter the password directly in the chat form, and the bot can’t see it.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOr take over the bot’s computer on the Instagram login page and log in yourself once. Enter the verification code there too if Instagram asks for it. After that, the bot’s browser should stay logged in.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLet me know if either option doesn’t work.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":5,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-30T05:06:22.307Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":4,"readers_count":3,"score":0.8,"yours":false,"topic_id":173365,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-shared-1password-autofill-says-filled-but-password-stays-empty-instagram","display_username":"Dean Rie","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"","bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":750,"hidden":false,"trust_level":4,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_vie